{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:cae20a472b964174","name":"Gladiator Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-cae20a472b964174","title":"Gladiator Talent Trees","revision":18217,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:48:10Z","sha256":"01a260c0aeb74cdf8472d9b796a781400344a66345a988d35218ae8141005b3c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18217","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gladiator%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-cae20a472b964174","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gladiator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gladiator","referenceId":"reference:1f0cc9c91ce64379"}," gains an additional Gladiator Talent. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gladiator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gladiator","referenceId":"reference:1f0cc9c91ce64379"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from any of the following Gladiator Talent Trees they wish, but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Gladiator Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Specialist Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Specialist_Talent_Tree","referenceId":